message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: faers-signal-pipeline
abstract: A reproducible pipeline for FDA Adverse Event Reporting System data spanning three data eras, computing PRR, ROR and chi-square disproportionality signals with byte-identical recomputation, data contracts with quarantine, RxNav drug normalization, and Temporal-orchestrated scheduling and backfill.
type: software
